<counter-demo class="counter-demo" aria-label="Interactive PN-counter demo">
  <div class="demo-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">TRY IT YOURSELF</p>
      <h2 id="counter-demo">Two copies. One counter.</h2>
    </div>
    <span class="mode" data-mode>Connecting…</span>
  </div>
  <p class="intro">Make a few changes on each device while they’re disconnected. Then sync them and watch every copy agree.</p>

  <div class="replicas">
    {['alice', 'bob'].map((name) => (
      <section class="replica" aria-label={`${name === 'alice' ? 'Alice' : 'Bob'}’s device`}>
        <div class="card-heading">
          <h3>{name === 'alice' ? 'Alice’s laptop' : 'Bob’s phone'}</h3>
          <span class="replica-state" data-replica-status={name}>In sync</span>
        </div>
        <output class="count" data-value={name} aria-label={`${name}’s counter`}>0</output>
        <div class="stepper">
          <button type="button" data-edit={name} data-map="n" aria-label={`Subtract one on ${name}’s device`} disabled>−</button>
          <span>Change locally</span>
          <button type="button" data-edit={name} data-map="p" aria-label={`Add one on ${name}’s device`} disabled>+</button>
        </div>
        <p class="totals">This device: <span data-totals={name}>+0 / −0</span></p>
      </section>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="merge-row">
    <div class="stored">
      <span data-stored-label>Last merged value</span>
      <output data-stored aria-label="Last merged counter value">0</output>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <button class="primary" type="button" data-sync disabled>Sync both devices</button>
      <button type="button" data-replay disabled>Replay last sync</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-message>Connecting to the demo…</p>
  <div class="demo-footer">
    <p data-note>Each visitor gets a separate counter. Refreshing starts over.</p>
    <button type="button" class="reset" data-reset disabled>Start over</button>
  </div>
  <details>
    <summary>See the counter state</summary>
    <p>Each device sends its running totals of additions (<code>p</code>) and subtractions (<code>n</code>). A merge keeps the larger total for each device, so a repeated delivery changes nothing.</p>
    <pre aria-label="Last merged CRDT state"><code data-json>{JSON.stringify({ t: 'pn', v: 1, p: {}, n: {} }, null, 2)}</code></pre>
    <p>In live mode, the server merges with <code>crdt.pn_apply_delta</code> in one atomic Postgres upsert.</p>
  </details>
  <noscript>Enable JavaScript to try the counter, or follow the counter quickstart below.</noscript>
</counter-demo>

<script>
  import '../scripts/counter-demo.mjs';
</script>

<style>
  .counter-demo { display: block; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: .75rem; padding: 1.5rem; margin-block: 2rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .counter-demo :is(p, h2, h3, pre, section, div, details, button) { margin: 0; }
  .demo-heading, .card-heading, .merge-row, .demo-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .09em; font-weight: 600; color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  h3 { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--sl-color-white); }
  .mode { font-size: .8125rem; border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 2rem; padding: .25rem .65rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .mode[data-live='true'] { color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .counter-demo .intro { margin-top: .75rem; max-width: 42rem; }
  .counter-demo .replicas { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-block: 1.5rem; }
  .replica { background: var(--sl-color-gray-6); border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: .5rem; padding: 1.25rem; }
  .replica-state { font-size: .75rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
  .count { display: block; color: var(--sl-color-white); font: 500 3.5rem/1.3 var(--docs-font-heading); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; text-align: center; padding-block: .75rem; }
  .stepper { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; font-size: .875rem; }
  button { appearance: none; font: inherit; font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--sl-color-white); background: var(--sl-color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-4); border-radius: .375rem; padding: .6rem .9rem; cursor: pointer; }
